1967,67,88,22]],"links":[["Grand Forks County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/north-dakota/grand-forks-county"],["ARC or PLC in Grand Forks County","/arc-plc/north-dakota/grand-forks-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 shows November to December came in under 90% of normal in 40 of 75 years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 14 grids, more often than any other pair. In 2025, January to February came in at 45% and February to March at 47% of normal on the middle of the grids. In 2026 so far, April to May sits at 76% on the middle of the grids. Grid 33129 had its driest year in 1976 at 54%.</p>"}
